  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Public Audit in Rwanda (SPAR) Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">More effective and comprehensive auditing of public spending in Rwanda through increasing (i) the overall audit coverage of government expenditure by 18.5% from 2011 to 2017;  (ii) the average annual number of value for money audits by 33% from 2011 to 2017 and  audit coverage of Government Business Enterprises annual expenditure from 0% in 2011 to 20% in 2017.</narrative>
  </description>
